, "statement": "If a concrete source-defined class selector maps its demands into REAL A rotations with global multiplicity at most k, then class size<=k R_A<=2kA, even if those rotations already pay old demands. A finite exhaustive partition of such independently controlled classes sums their constants honestly.", "recorded_status": "Scope-specific theorem or obstruction as recorded in source"}, {"id": "relaxed_cd_do_bridge", "label": "Any absolute coarse-double constant suffices for DO", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\Saif malik\\OneDrive\\Documents\\Desktop\\Temp\\splay-multiscale-transfer-liquidity-k6c2\\DO_RESEARCH_REBOOT\\ROUTE04_RELAXED_UNIVERSAL_CD_20261108\\RELAXED_UNIVERSAL_CD_DISCOVERY_STEP01.md", "source_location": "139", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-20", "author": null, "contributor": null, "statement": "If some absolute C bounds Q_B<=CA on EVERY original diagonally reachable closed source at all supports and starting trees, C.ZIG gives B<=(C+1)A. Reachable-cycle excision gives E_B<=(C+1)S_A+g(T0), g=(Cat_n^2-1)floor(n/2). Exact LT cost conversion gives eventual monotonicity with universal multiplier, hence external Levy-Tarjan Theorem4.3 yields DO.", "recorded_status": "Conditional downstream implications and converse are source-recorded symbolic proofs. External paper not independently browsed/reverified in this subtask; parent must verify precise citation/model. No DO proof supplied because universal finite-C premise is open."}, {"id": "historical_absolute_renewal_candidate", "label": "Historical absolute unexposed-forest renewal candidate", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\Saif malik\\OneDrive\\Documents\\Desktop\\Temp\\splay-multiscale-transfer-liquidity-k6c2\\DO_RESEARCH_REBOOT\\ROUTE04_RELAXED_UNIVERSAL_CD_20261108\\RELAXED_UNIVERSAL_CD_DISCOVERY_STEP01.md", "source_location": "529", "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-11-20", "author": null, "contributor": null, "statement